sequenceDiagram
    participant App as Application
    participant Ctx as llama_context
    participant Decode as llama_decode
    participant Logits as Logit Pipeline
    participant Chain as llama_sampler_chain
    participant S1 as Sampler (top-k)
    participant S2 as Sampler (dist)
    participant Pipe as common_sampler (optional)
    participant Gram as Grammar Sampler

    Note over App,Pipe: Standard sampling flow (CPU)

    App->>Ctx: llama_sampler_chain_init()<br/>src/llama-sampler.cpp:792
    App->>Chain: llama_sampler_chain_add(top-k)
    App->>Chain: llama_sampler_chain_add(dist)
    App->>Ctx: llama_sampler_sample(chain, ctx, idx)<br/>src/llama-sampler.cpp:806

    Ctx->>Logits: get logits for idx<br/>llama_get_logits_ith() /<br/>llama_get_sampled_token_ith()

    alt Backend already sampled
        Logits-->>Ctx: sampled_token != LLAMA_TOKEN_NULL
        Ctx-->>App: return sampled_token<br/>src/llama-sampler.cpp:813
    else CPU fallback
        Logits-->>Ctx: raw logits
        Ctx->>Chain: llama_sampler_apply(chain, &cur_p)<br/>src/llama-sampler.cpp:864

        loop For each sampler in chain<br/>src/llama-sampler.cpp:642-661
            Chain->>S1: apply(&cur_p) — top-k truncation
            alt is_backend == true
                Note over Chain,S1: Skipped on CPU — runs in ggml graph
            end
            Chain->>S2: apply(&cur_p) — softmax + dist sampling
            S2-->>Chain: cur_p.selected set
        end

        Chain-->>Ctx: cur_p.selected
        Ctx->>Ctx: llama_sampler_accept(token)<br/>src/llama-sampler.cpp:870
        Ctx-->>App: token ID
    end

    Note over App,Gram: common_sampler + grammar flow<br/>common/sampling.cpp:540-621

    App->>Pipe: common_sampler_sample(gsmpl, ctx, idx)
    Pipe->>Ctx: llama_synchronize()
    Pipe->>Pipe: set_logits(ctx, idx)

    alt Backend already sampled
        Pipe-->>App: return backend token
    else Apply reasoning budget
        Pipe->>Pipe: llama_sampler_apply(rbudget, &cur_p)
    end

    alt grammar_first == true
        Pipe->>Gram: llama_sampler_apply(grmr, &cur_p)<br/>apply grammar before chain
    end

    Pipe->>Chain: llama_sampler_apply(chain, &cur_p)<br/>standard sampling
    Chain-->>Pipe: sampled ID

    alt grammar_first == false && grammar active
        Pipe->>Gram: validate single token against grammar<br/>llama_sampler_apply(grmr, &single_token)
        Gram-->>Pipe: valid/invalid
        alt Invalid — resample
            Pipe->>Pipe: set_logits() again
            Pipe->>Gram: llama_sampler_apply(grmr, &cur_p)<br/>full grammar mask
            Pipe->>Chain: llama_sampler_apply(chain, &cur_p)<br/>resample
            Chain-->>Pipe: resampled ID
        end
    end

    Pipe-->>App: token ID

    Note over App,Gram: Speculative decoding flow<br/>common/sampling.cpp:624-660

    App->>Pipe: common_sampler_sample_and_accept_n(gsmpl, ctx, draft)
    loop For each draft position<br/>until mismatch
        Pipe->>Chain: sample token
        Pipe->>Pipe: common_sampler_accept(token, true)
        alt draft[i] != sampled token
            App-->>Pipe: break — return accepted tokens
        end
    end
    Pipe-->>App: vector~llama_token~ (accepted)

    Note over App,Chain: Backend (GPU) sampling flow<br/>src/llama-context.cpp:112-129<br/>tests/test-backend-sampler.cpp

    App->>Ctx: llama_init_from_model(model, params)<br/>with params.samplers = configs
    Ctx->>Ctx: set_sampler(seq_id, chain)<br/>llama-context.cpp:123
    Ctx->>S1: backend_init(buft)<br/>check op support
    S1-->>Ctx: res (true/false)

    App->>Ctx: llama_decode(batch)
    Ctx->>Ctx: build ggml compute graph
    Note over Ctx: backend_init called once<br/>backend_apply builds graph nodes
    Note over Ctx: backend_set_input feeds runtime data<br/>backend_accept for accept hooks
    Ctx-->>App: logits (potentially reduced by backend samplers)
